KnightOS
=========

In fact, KnightOS is only a Kernel at this time,
forming by the past of time, this Kernel is starting to
turn into a Operative System based on Shell and 
efficiency, at the last that's all at nowadays.

Quick Start:
------------

If is your first time contribuiting to this project
you might start reporting bugs, talking with other developer
or making suggestion.

Every single sand stand is sufficient to be a star,
we dont want execelncy, we want transparent developers
and helpers that stays in the family because they like it.

In that case, welcome to the Knight's Family, pass by our
Discord Community to meet new people.
